Package: dogecoin-core-pro
Version: __VERSION__-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: adduser, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, systemd | systemd-sysv, libdb5.3++ | libdb5.3++t64, libevent-2.1-7 | libevent-2.1-7t64, libzmq5, libssl3 | libssl3t64
Conflicts: dogecoin-gpenode, dogecoind
Replaces: dogecoin-gpenode, dogecoind
Provides: dogecoin-gpenode
Maintainer: The Retarded Elon <noreply@gopastearth.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/TheRetardedElon/Dogecoin-Takeback
Description: Dogecoin Core Pro (Client / Server / Hybrid)
 One dogecoind plus optional ImGui desktop GUI and/or operator TUI.
 Same mainnet consensus as Core Pro / GPENode. Not a second coin.
 .
 First install asks: Client, Server, or Hybrid (debconf).
 Reconfigure with: sudo dpkg-reconfigure dogecoin-core-pro
 Preseed: dogecoin-core-pro dogecoin-core-pro/install-role select server
 .
 Client: user-session node (~/.dogecoin). Server/Hybrid: systemd unit
 dogecoin-core-pro and datadir /var/lib/dogecoin-core-pro.
 RPC binds to 127.0.0.1 only.
 .
 This package absorbs dogecoin-gpenode (transitional Provides/Replaces).
